Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:45:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): reject model-pinned specs and route legacy
 cards dynamically [daveey]

Work in progress: mutation and admission enforcement plus consumer migrations. Preserves author provenance, quota and reserve gates; does not alter interactive sessions. Fleet remediation and broader consumer proof are still pending; not ready to land.
